{"articleNo":"193885","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=193885&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[근로]국가근로(교외) 모집 안내(코레일 동대구역)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.06.19","hit":"4632","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">코레일에서 하계방학 동안 근무할 국가근로 학생을 모집합니다.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">*2018-1학기 국가근로 자격을 갖춘 재학생만 해당됨을 알려드립니다.*</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">*영어회화가 가능한 학생을 원합니다.(외국인 안내에 필요)*</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">* 선발 완료하였습니다.(선발된 학생들에게 개별 연락함)</span></span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">1. 근로지 내역</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 가. 근로지 :&nbsp;코레일 동대구역</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 나. 근로 업무 :&nbsp;여객안내,&nbsp;고객편의 서비스 제공, 여행상품 안내, 행정업무 지원</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 다. 근로 기간 : 1학기 하계방학 중 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; [코레일 동대구역과&nbsp;협의 후 진행, 예산에 따라 축소 가능]</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2. 선정 관련</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 가. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\">선정 인원</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 주중 1일 8시간 근무 : 1명</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 주말 1일 8시간 근무 : 1명</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;선정 기준&nbsp; : 학기 초과 제외</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 소득순위 : 1순위&gt;2순위&gt;3순위&gt;</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;소득순위가 동일할 경우 직전학기 성적</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;직전학기 성적이 동일할 경우</span></span></span></span></span></p></span></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">3. 신청 관련</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;신청기간 : ~2018.6.20.(수) 18시</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp; 나.&nbsp;신청방법</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학과 / 학번 / 성명 / 연락처&nbsp;/ 주중, 주말 중 선택(필수)</span></span></p></span></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 이메일(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"mailto:dala0608@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">dala0608@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">) 신청</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span></span><p styl